    "Runs the agent and its tools inside its Boat virtual machine. The VM wakes automatically for each run; keep OpenMausBot running so its scheduler can launch the job.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roda o agente e as ferramentas dele dentro da máquina virtual Boat. A VM acorda automaticamente a cada execução; mantenha o OpenMausBot rodando para que o agendador consiga iniciar o trabalho."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Boat 虚拟机中运行机器人及其工具。每次运行时 VM 都会自动启动；请保持 OpenMausBot 运行，调度器才能启动工作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Boat 虛擬機器中執行機器人及其工具。每次執行時 VM 都會自動啟動；請保持 OpenMausBot 執行，排程器才能啟動工作。"
          }
        }
      }
